<title>MALAYSIA: Diversified Resources year net higher.</title>
<headline>Diversified Resources year net higher.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	    125.85	vs	 47.30</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    47.8	 vs	 18.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	    2,553.29	vs     1,311.39</p>
<p>    Pretax profit	 304.71	vs	  99.46</p>
<p>    Minorities less	70.52	vs less   12.24</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	  nil	vs	 372.51</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	7.5	 vs	   2.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Diversified Resources Bhd is involved in investment holding, assembling, distributing and selling motor vehicles and other operations.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
